WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.235
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.704
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:04.704 --> 00:00:06.072
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.072 --> 00:00:09.609
According to a new report,
Chinese President Xi Jinping

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:12.178
assured President Biden
during their in-person meeting

00:00:12.178 --> 00:00:14.480
in November
that China would not interfere

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.682
in the upcoming
U.S. presidential election.

00:00:16.682 --> 00:00:19.652
Great. You know this election
is going to be the worst

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:22.922
even when countries that
interfered in previous ones

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:26.492
are like, "We good."

00:00:26.492 --> 00:00:28.894
President Biden is set to fly
to Michigan tomorrow

00:00:28.894 --> 00:00:31.664
for a campaign event hosted
by the United Auto Workers.

00:00:31.664 --> 00:00:34.768
But if they ask, he drove.

00:00:36.002 --> 00:00:38.338
Billionaire hedge-fund manager
John Paulson

00:00:38.338 --> 00:00:40.439
is set to hold
a fundraiser tomorrow

00:00:40.439 --> 00:00:41.674
for former President Trump

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:44.411
at his $110 million
Palm Beach mansion.

00:00:44.411 --> 00:00:46.045
Why is that guy
doing a fundraiser?

00:00:46.045 --> 00:00:49.682
You clearly have funds.
Just give him the money.

00:00:49.682 --> 00:00:52.084
It's like if you tried to borrow
some money from Smaug,

00:00:52.084 --> 00:00:54.721
and he said,
"Well, we could do a car wash."

00:00:56.889 --> 00:01:00.526
California Governor Gavin Newsom
announced new measures yesterday

00:01:00.526 --> 00:01:02.729
to restore the state's
salmon population,

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.597
and it's a little suspicious
that he announced

00:01:04.597 --> 00:01:07.801
it right after meeting
with these lobbyists.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.674
Authorities in Connecticut
recently arrested a man

00:01:14.674 --> 00:01:16.976
after he allegedly stole
an ice-cream truck

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:19.578
with $30,000 worth
of product inside.

00:01:19.578 --> 00:01:21.747
He faces up to 10 years
in prison

00:01:21.747 --> 00:01:24.918
with zero chance
of being pardoned.

00:01:28.454 --> 00:01:34.093
A horse in Ohio recently tested
positive for methamphetamine,

00:01:34.093 --> 00:01:37.830
in case you're wondering
how they make Krazy Glue.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.866
[ Audience groans ]

00:01:46.038 --> 00:01:50.776
I'll wait till
everyone's done being sad.

00:01:50.776 --> 00:01:53.513
IBM has reportedly
told its U.S.-based managers

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:55.214
that they must report
to work in person

00:01:55.214 --> 00:01:57.450
at least three days a week
or leave their jobs,

00:01:57.450 --> 00:01:59.085
which is pretty rich
coming from the people

00:01:59.085 --> 00:02:01.287
who basically invented
the personal computer.

00:02:01.287 --> 00:02:04.991
You're the ones who made it
so easy to work at home.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:06.492
That would be like Ford saying,
"You know,

00:02:06.492 --> 00:02:10.796
we'd really prefer people
came to work by horse."

00:02:10.796 --> 00:02:13.499
Two men who were stranded
on a kayak in the Gulf of Mexico

00:02:13.499 --> 00:02:15.701
were rescued this week
by a Carnival cruise ship,

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:19.572
but there was improv that night,
so they asked to go back.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:24.243
And, finally,
in honor of Valentine's Day,

00:02:24.243 --> 00:02:26.479
Starbucks launched
two new drinks yesterday --

00:02:26.479 --> 00:02:28.948
the chocolate-covered
Strawberry Crème Frappuccino

00:02:28.948 --> 00:02:31.718
and the Chocolate Hazelnut
Cookie Cold Brew.

00:02:31.718 --> 00:02:33.485
And just like
your first Valentine,

00:02:33.485 --> 00:02:35.287
they'll break your heart.

00:02:35.287 --> 00:02:37.223
And that was
the monologue, everybody.

00:02:37.223 --> 00:02:38.925
We are off and running.

